BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nyc-20261203-17@tonight
DTSTAMP:20261128T114200Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261203T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261203T200000
SUMMARY:Music Makers Tribute to the Heavy Hitters
LOCATION:Iridium\, Midtown-Times Square
DESCRIPTION:Music Makers Tribute to... The Heavy Hitters bring some of the 
 
biggest artists\, most influential songs\, and most enduring sounds in musi
 
c history to one of New York City's most iconic live music stages: the Irid
 
ium in the heart of Times Square. Featuring two distinct tribute experience
 
s\, The Heavy Hitters will move across genres and generations\, celebrating
 
 artists whose music has become part of the soundtrack of our lives. Whethe
 
r you're drawn to the powerhouse vocals and deep grooves of classic soul or
 
 the unmistakable piano-driven hits of Billy Joel and Elton John\, you'll h
 
ave the opportunity to enjoy music that has inspired generations of musicia
 
ns and audiences. SOUL ROYALTY: The Voices That Defined Soul﻿ Soul Royalt
 
y celebrates the legendary singers\, unforgettable grooves\, and timeless s
 
ongs that defined the genre---from Aretha Franklin\, Otis Redding\, Sam Coo
 
ke\, and Marvin Gaye to Al Green\, Stevie Wonder\, and beyond. KINGS OF KEY
 
S: The Piano Legends Who Changed Music ﻿Billy Joel. Elton John. Two legen
 
dary piano players. Decades of unforgettable songs. ﻿Step into the world 
 
of piano-driven classic rock and delight in the iconic parts\, soaring melo
 
dies\, and timeless songs that made these artists household names. I'm Ever
 
y Woman starring Mona Swain presented by 24k Theatre Co. 24k Theatre Co. pr
 
esents I'm Every Woman\, starring Mona Swain! From portraying Tina Turner i
 
n the national tour of TINA: The Tina Turner Musical to bringing Whitney Ho
 
uston's iconic hits to life in The Bodyguard and stepping into the world of
 
 Donna Summer\, Mona has embodied three of music's most legendary women. Fo
 
r one night only\, experience Mona bringing all three of her iconic roles t
 
ogether on one stage at The Iridium! Presented by 24k Theatre Co.\, an accl
 
aimed\, female-led\, internationally based production company whose credits
 
 include Just a Piano\, Night of the Living Legends\, and productions at 54
 
 Below\, The Triad\, and the Toronto Fringe Festival. Dedicated to honoring
 
 the past while shaping the future\, 24k brings its signature celebration o
 
f extraordinary talent and timeless music to this unforgettable evening! Ma
 
d Staggers Get ready for a detonation of unapologetic\, dirty rock and roll
 
 as NYC's premier powerpop-infused outfit\, the Mad Staggers\, bring their 
 
ferocious\, high-voltage energy to the legendary stage at The Iridium. Know
 
n for tearing up the local club scene with an old-school rock mentality\, t
 
his formidable four-piece combines the gritty charisma of The Faces with he
 
avy powerpop hooks. Fronted by the magnetic Chris Campion\, the lineup feat
 
ures Benny Landa on guitar\, Gary Bristol on bass\, and Keith Foley driving
 
 the beat on drums. About Music Makers Bob Elliott's Music Makers is NYC's 
 
premier band ensemble program\, where business professionals and passionate
 
 music enthusiasts come together to rehearse\, refine their craft\, and per
 
form live. BEMM has performed over 700 shows at iconic venues like South St
 
reet Seaport\, Alice Tully Hall\, The Cutting Room\, The Bitter End\, and m
 
any more\, delivering unforgettable live music experiences. In addition to 
 
musicianship development\, we also provide a top-tier rehearsal space\, off
 
ering world-class service to musicians from around the globe. Tickets & inf
 
o: https://www.ticketweb.com/event/music-makers-tribute-to-the-iridium-tick
 
ets/14404614
URL:https://www.ticketweb.com/event/music-makers-tribute-to-the-iridium-tic
 
kets/14404614
END:VEVENT
