SUMMARY:The Ick: Live!
LOCATION:Brooklyn Improv (The Main Room)\, Williamsburg
DESCRIPTION:Submit Your Ick (@submityourick) is the Webby\, Telly\, and Sho
 
rty Award-winning internet home for the ick: that one tiny\, irrational thi
 
ng a person does that makes you never want to see them again. What started 
 
as an Instagram account collecting anonymous dating confessions has grown i
 
nto a community of more than 700\,000 followers\, over 120 million views\, 
 
and more than 20\,000 submissions. For years\, our followers have confessed
 
 their icks to us anonymously. Now we're putting the ick to the test in fro
 
nt of a live audience. Comedians and longtime friends Emily Wilson and Sam 
 
Blumefeld will guide our bachelorette along her romantic journey. Sam actua
 
lly officiated Emily's wedding\, so they both know a thing or two about lov
 
e. Emily is a New York comedian whose special was recently featured in the 
 
New York Times. Sam is a comedian and writer who collaborates closely with 
 
Chloe Troast on Spilling Your Seed. Each round of the night is designed to 
 
draw out exactly the kind of Icky moments our followers have been submittin
 
g for years. One bachelorette will date four bachelors behind a wall. At th
 
e end of every round\, the bachelorette hits the ick button and sends one b
 
achelor home. The last man standing gets the date. DO NOT PURCHASE TICKETS 
 
FROM ANYONE OR ANY OTHER SITE OTHER THAN IMPROV.COM TICKET RESALE IS STRICT
 
LY PROHIBITED. TICKETS SUSPECTED OF BEING PURCHASED FOR THE SOLE PURPOSE OF
 
 RESELLING MAY BE CANCELLED AT THE DISCRETION OF THE BROOKLYN IMPROV. EVENT
 
 INFO: There is a two-item minimum purchase requirement in the showroom for
 
 all guests. Seating is general admission\, first-come\, first-served\, wit
 
h the exception of groups and premium booths. No cell phone use\, photograp
 
hy or video recording is permitted during performances. All sales are final
 
. MISCELLANOUS: For group sales info\, e-mail our Events Manager to learn a
 
bout special menu options and reserved seating. Additional questions may be
 
 addressed in our Frequently Asked Questions. For further assistance\, cont
 
act Brooklyn Improv. Tickets & info: https://www.ticketweb.com/event/the-ic
 
k-live-brooklyn-improv-the-main-room-tickets/14435774
URL:https://www.ticketweb.com/event/the-ick-live-brooklyn-improv-the-main-r
 
oom-tickets/14435774
END:VEVENT
